        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Pajeon is one of the simplest "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "jeon",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "jeon"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " pancakes to make. Whole spring onions go into the batter and the pancake is cooked until the outside is deeply golden and crunchy. Serves 4 as a side or starter."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Traditional recipes use a splash of "
          },
          {
